Problem:
A competitive swimmer is training heavily and to do so, plans to eat steaks and chicken breasts over the coming week. Each steak contains 900 calories and 40 g of protein. Each chicken breast contains 700 calories and 20 g of protein. He prefers to eat chicken breasts and decides to eat at least 2 times as many chicken breasts as steaks over the coming week. However, he must also eat at least 10 steaks over the week. If he must consume at least 1200 g of protein over this coming week, how many steaks and chicken breasts should he eat to minimize the total amount of calories he is eating?

Model and facts:
